\code{AOCCPIFL}) are unique within the same groups. \code{APERIOD} is added to every
group if it is populated, as multi-period designs (e.g. vaccine studies)
flag the first occurrence per period.

Any other flag, e.g. a sponsor-defined \code{AOCC01FL}, is not checked, as its
group cannot be told from its name; neither is a flag whose body system or
dictionary term variable is not in the dataset. Fewer than one \code{"Y"} per
